{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2021-10-08 01:50:00', 'title': 'EVOTEC EXPANDS NEUROSCIENCE COLLABORATION WITH BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB TO INCLUDE NOVEL CELL TYPE', 'text': 'INCLUDES NEW CELL TYPES FOR STUDYING MOLECULAR DISEASE SIGNATURES FOR DISCOVERY OF DISEASE-MODIFYING THERAPIES FOR NEURODEGENERATIVE DISEASES TRIGGERS US$ 9.0 M PAYMENT TO EVOTEC HAMBURG, GERMANY / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 8, 2021 / EVOTEC SE (FRANKFURT STOCK EXCHANGE: EVT, MDAX/TECDAX, ISIN: DE0005664809) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS COLLABORATION WITH BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB (NYSE: BMY) HAS BEEN EXPANDED TO INCLUDE A NEW CELL TYPE, TRIGGERING A PAYMENT OF $ 9.0 M TO EVOTEC. THE COLLABORATION WAS INITIATED IN DECEMBER 2016 WITH THE GOAL OF IDENTIFYING DISEASE-MODIFYING TREATMENTS FOR A BROAD RANGE OF NEURODEGENERATIVE DISEASES.'}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2021-10-08 07:00:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANK TAKES TOP SPOT NATIONALLY FOR SBA 7(A) LOAN ORIGINATION BY VOLUME FOR FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNTINGTON NATIONAL BANK (NASDAQ: HBAN; WWW.HUNTINGTON.COM) IS THE NATION'S LARGEST ORIGINATOR, BY VOLUME, OF SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION (SBA) 7(A) LOANS FOR THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR AT THE CLOSE OF SBA FISCAL YEAR 2021, FURTHER STRENGTHENING ITS POSITION AS THE LEADER IN SUPPORTING SMALL BUSINESSES. THIS ALSO MARKS THE 13TH YEAR IN A ROW HUNTINGTON HAS BEEN THE LARGEST ORIGINATOR, BY VOLUME, OF SBA 7(A) LOANS WITHIN ITS FOOTPRINT."}{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2021-10-08 06:00:00', 'title': "GLOBAL ENERGY LEADERS TO CONVENE AT INDIA ENERGY FORUM BY CERAWEEK CONFERENCE TO DISCUSS TURBULENT MARKETS; A NEW ERA OF ENERGY CRISES AND SHORTAGES; INDIA'S ENERGY FUTURE, THE OUTLOOK FOR ENERGY TRANSITION AHEAD OF COP26, AND MORE", 'text': 'NEW DELHI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE INDIA ENERGY FORUM BY CERAWEEK TO BE HELD IN NEW DELHI, AS WELL AS VIRTUALLY, OCTOBER 20-22.'}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-10-08 03:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE, TIM (TELECOM ITALIA) AND NOOVLE ANNOUNCE JOINT PLAN TO OFFER MULTICLOUD SERVICES IN ITALY', 'text': "ROME AND AUSTIN, TEXAS, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ORACLE, TIM (TELECOM ITALIA) AND NOOVLE, TIM GROUP'S CLOUD COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE SIGNED A COLLABORATION AGREEMENT AS PART OF A PLAN TO OFFER MULTICLOUD SERVICES FOR ENTERPRISES AND PUBLIC SECTOR ORGANIZATIONS IN ITALY. UNDER THE AGREEMENT, TIM GROUP PLANS TO UTILIZE ADVANCED CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE TECHNOLOGIES TO SUPPORT ITS GOAL OF ADVANCING ITALY'S DIGITAL MODERNIZATION AND ESTABLISHING ITS POSITION, THROUGH NOOVLE, AS THE MARKET REFERENCE POINT FOR ENTERPRISE MULTICLOUD SERVICES IN THE COUNTRY."}{'symbol': 'OTIS', 'date': '2021-10-08 06:30:00', 'title': 'OTIS THIRD QUARTER 2021 EARNINGS ADVISORY', 'text': 'FARMINGTON, CONN., OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0OTIS WORLDWIDE CORPORATION (NYSE: OTIS) WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL ON MONDAY, OCTOBER 25, 2021, AT 8:30 A.M.'}{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2021-10-08 07:30:00', 'title': 'QUALCOMM APPOINTS ANN CHAPLIN AS GENERAL COUNSEL & CORPORATE SECRETARY', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUALCOMM INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: QCOM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ANN CHAPLIN HAS BEEN APPOINTED GENERAL COUNSEL & CORPORATE SECRETARY, REPORTING DIRECTLY TO CRISTIANO AMON, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF QUALCOMM INCORPORATED, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 1. DON ROSENBERG, GENERAL COUNSEL AND CORPORATE SECRETARY SINCE 2007, WILL SERVE AS SPECIAL ADVISOR FOR POLICY, REGULATION AND STRATEGIC INITIATIVES UNTIL HIS RETIREMENT AT THE END OF THE YEAR.'}{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-10-08 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE AND ONE CLICK LCA COLLABORATE TO PROVIDE EMBODIED CARBON CALCULATIONS FOR DIFFERENT PHASES OF CONSTRUCTION PROJECTS', 'text': "SUNNYVALE, CALIF. AND HELSINKI, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A COLLABORATION WITH ONE CLICK LCA THAT ENABLES USERS OF TRIMBLE'S TEKLA BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING (BIM)\xa0SOFTWARE TO CALCULATE CARBON EMISSIONS AT DIFFERENT PHASES OF A PROJECT, HELPING TO MOVE THE NEEDLE TOWARD A NET ZERO FUTURE FOR CONSTRUCTION."}{'symbol': 'WELL', 'date': '2021-10-08 08:00:00', 'title': "MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE REVISES WELLTOWER'S OUTLOOK TO STABLE AND AFFIRMS 'BAA1' ISSUER CREDIT RATING", 'text': 'TOLEDO, OHIO, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WELLTOWER INC. (NYSE: WELL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MOODY\'S INVESTORS SERVICE ("MOODY\'S") HAS REVISED ITS RATING OUTLOOK FOR WELLTOWER TO STABLE FROM NEGATIVE AND AFFIRMED WELLTOWER\'S ISSUER CREDIT RATING AS \'BAA1\'. MOODY\'S EMPHASIZED THAT THE STABLE OUTLOOK REFLECTS STEADY IMPROVEMENT IN THE SENIORS HOUSING OPERATING PORTFOLIO AND A CONTINUED RECOVERY IN CASH FLOWS.'}{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2021-10-08 08:00:00', 'title': 'WYNN RESORTS RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE TOP PLACES TO WORK IN NEVADA', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WYNN RESORTS ANNOUNCES THAT IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE BEST EMPLOYERS IN NEVADA ON THE TOP WORKPLACES NEVADA 2021 LIST BY THE LAS VEGAS REVIEW-JOURNAL AND BUSINESS PRESS, WITH WYNN LAS VEGAS RANKING AS THE BEST RESORT ON THE LAS VEGAS STRIP. ADDITIONALLY, WYNN RESORTS CEO MATT MADDOX EARNED THE LEADERSHIP CONFIDENCE AWARD IN THE LARGE COMPANIES CATEGORY.'}